---
// "Coming soon": marks a feature that is planned and not built yet, so no
// page promises what g1t can't do. Inline, beside a heading or in a line.
---

<span class="soon not-content">Coming soon</span>

<style>
	.soon {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid var(--g1t-line-strong);
		background: var(--g1t-raised);
		color: var(--g1t-muted);
		font-family: var(--g1t-font-mono);
		font-size: 0.6875rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		white-space: nowrap;
		vertical-align: middle;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
</style>
